 table('2','Table02_Dataset_Overview','Hourly dataset partitions, temporal coverage and weather composition.', ['Dataset','Hours','Dates','Date coverage','Time','Rain','Overcast','Clear/dry','Other'],rows,'Date coverage gives the first and last retained dates, not continuous recording. Local partitions are the original random-hour split (seed 20260928); dates can overlap across splits. UK pooled contains 236 station-days but 143 distinct UTC dates. Weather columns are mutually exclusive and sum to Hours. The hourly UK model summary merges Clear/dry into Other; Table~6 retains that original grouping.', ['Table02_datasets.csv'],spec='lrrllrrrr')
 # 3. Config values come from manifests; preserve the unusual but frozen RF choice.
